OL,3,GNEWSATeenager, 15, denies 22 sexual
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old boy has pleaded not
OL,7,Fguilty to 22 sexual offences, including
OL,8,Frape, against eight girls.
OL,10,FThe teenager, who cannot be named
OL,11,Fbecause of his age, was charged with
OL,12,Fone count of rape, rape of a child
OL,13,Funder 13 and assault by penetration at
OL,14,FNorthampton Crown Court on Friday.
OL,16,FThe offences are alleged to have taken
OL,17,Fplace between 2023 and 2025, with the
OL,18,Fvictims aged between 10 and 15.
OL,20,FHis trial is due to begin at the same
OL,21,Fcourt on 25 October 2027 and is
OL,22,Fexpected to last three to four weeks.
